===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Mawile|129}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
*'''Powerful Vise''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Battle Styles|Mawile|100}} from the {{TCG|Battle Styles}} expansion.
